worm-api-reference:

- When writing code that calls the Worm API or `worm-sdk`, fetch real schemas with the `read_worm_docs` tool (no args for the index, then pass a path) instead of guessing field names.
- API base is `https://api.worm.wtf`. Rate limits: 120 req/min public, 300 req/min authenticated, 10 req/min for auth bootstrap. List endpoints paginate with `cursor`.
- Python SDK: `pip install "worm-sdk[signing]"`. Signing happens locally with a Solana keypair; never send private keys to any API.
